    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An abandoned boarding school\u2026 Footsteps echoing through silent hallways\u2026 And a vengeful spirit from the past\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, a tragic event at a boarding school took a dear friend from you. But this story didn\u2019t end with death. Now, you\u2019ve been called back to that dark past through a letter. In the ruins of this abandoned school, the restless spirit of your friend awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned rooms, find hidden keys, and try to escape the grip of a deadly danger. But be careful\u2026 They\u2019re watching your every move, and this time, scaring you won\u2019t be their only game.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >An abandoned boarding school\u2026 Footsteps echoing through silent hallways\u2026 And a vengeful spirit from the past\u2026</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years ago, a tragic event at a boarding school took a dear friend from you. But this story didn\u2019t end with death. Now, you\u2019ve been called back to that dark past through a letter. In the ruins of this abandoned school, the restless spirit of your friend awaits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the abandoned rooms, find hidden keys, and try to escape the grip of a deadly danger. But be careful\u2026 They\u2019re watching your every move, and this time, scaring you won\u2019t be their only game.</p>",
    "short_description": "The Unrested is a story-driven first-person horror game. A spirit from your past traps you in an abandoned boarding school. A shadow watching your every step will test you with puzzles while forcing you to confront your fears.",
